How we would know I was right:
- A test I would write, and who wrote it: for the next N pages under the new W3.6, a second agent re-makes the comparison from the page alone. Right means the verdicts agree on nearly all and every disagreement traces to a missing basis (not a different value). This check is mine and does not establish the chosen form was best — only that the comparison is reproducible. This mirrors the prior answer's honest check.
